# A reply cut at the output token limit is continued without showing the
# continuation message (internal/harness/output_limit.go, as Claude Code
# does); a reply that keeps getting cut ends with an error saying why.
@faux testdata/faux/qa/errors-output-limit.yaml

WAITFOR /describe a task/ 20
SEND write the long answer
WAITFOR /Part two, finished\./ 20
SHOT continued
EXPECT /Part one of the answer\./
EXPECT_NOT /Output token limit hit/
SEND keep going
WAITFOR /stopped at the output token limit/ 30
SHOT gave-up
EXPECT /Chunk D\./
EXPECT /4 times in a row/
EXPECT_NOT /Output token limit hit/
EXPECT_NOT /panic|goroutine/
